    "swish-gated-linear-unit-markdown-code-1": "SiLU(x₁) = x₁ × σ(x₁)\nσ(x) = 1 / (1 + e^(-x))\nSWiGLU(x₁, x₂) = SiLU(x₁) × x₂",
    "swish-gated-linear-unit-markdown-code-2": "输入：[1.0, 2.0, 3.0, 4.0]，N = 4\n输出：[2.1931758, 7.0463767]",
